+# Perf history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured figures available.
+
+There's a smoke test for this already (`crates/muninn-capture/src/lib.rs`,
+`smoke::parses_real_transcripts_when_present`), which parses a real transcript
+from `~/.claude/projects/-home-ilien-Projects-muninn` and prints turn/episode/tool
+counts. It does not print size in MB or wall-clock ingest time.
+
+I tried to run it in this checkout to get numbers. `cargo build` / `cargo test`
+both require approval that this sandbox does not grant, and no `target/` build
+exists here to run directly. So size (MB), turn count, episode count, and
+ingest time are all unmeasured — not filled in to avoid inventing numbers.
+
+To fill this in: run
+`cargo test -p muninn-capture --lib smoke::parses_real_transcripts_when_present -- --nocapture`
+outside this sandbox, wrap it with `time`, and note the size of the transcript
+file it picks (`ls -la` on the first `.jsonl` in that directory).
